{"code":0,"data":{"title":"快应用调起收银台","content":"<h1 id=\"s-t07pqtxr\">一、接口声明</h1><pre><code>{ \"name\": \"service.pay\" }</code></pre><h1 id=\"s-f780jj2r\"><br>二、导入模块</h1><pre><code>import pay from '@service.pay' 或 const pay = require('@service.pay')</code></pre><h1 id=\"s-eipcs9kd\"><br>三、接口定义</h1><h2 id=\"s-ftabi21h\">1、pay.getProvider()<code>1000+</code></h2><p><strong>定义</strong>：获取服务提供商</p><p><strong>参数</strong>：无</p><p><strong>返回值</strong>：字符串，服务提供商的代号，如厂商的英文品牌名称，假如无此服务则返回空字符串。</p><p><strong>示例</strong>：</p><pre><code>console.log(pay.getProvider())</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-frno8pb3\">2、pay.requestCashierPayment(OBJECT)<strong>（最小支持引擎版本</strong><code>12000500</code>）</h2><p><strong>定义</strong>：拉起支付收银台</p><p><strong>参数</strong>：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\"><p><strong>必填</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"818\" style=\"width: 818px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>orderInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>OBJECT</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"818\" style=\"width: 818px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单信息</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>success</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Function</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"818\" style=\"width: 818px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>成功调起支付渠道app后回调此方法，并不代表订单支付成功，订单状态以服务端查询接口返回结果为准</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>fail</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Function</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"818\" style=\"width: 818px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付渠道app调起失败后回调此方法</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>orderInfo支持的key：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\"><p><strong>必填</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"821\" style=\"width: 821px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>OBJECT</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"96\" style=\"width: 96px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"821\" style=\"width: 821px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/816\">服务端构建的收银台下单参数</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>success：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"333\" style=\"width: 333px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>data</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>OBJECT</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"333\" style=\"width: 333px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>包含状态码code和成功信息message</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>fail：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\"><p><strong>参数名</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\"><p><strong>类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"333\" style=\"width: 333px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Integer</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"333\" style=\"width: 333px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回状态码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"173\" style=\"width: 173px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>message</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"143\" style=\"width: 143px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"333\" style=\"width: 333px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>错误信息</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>code 说明：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\"><p><strong>状态码</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\"><p><strong>说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付成功</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>100</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>取消支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>200</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>201</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付渠道（微信、支付宝）app未安装</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>202</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>请求过频</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>203</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口参数异常</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>204</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付信息异常</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>205</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>调用支付能力失败</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>206</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付失败，请重新支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"176\" style=\"width: 176px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>300</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"475\" style=\"width: 475px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>其他错误</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>示例</strong>：</p><pre><code>// 1.请求开发者的服务端构建下单参数接口\nfetch.fetch({\n  url: 'your order url',\n  method: 'POST',\n  data: requestData,\n  responseType: 'json',\n  success: function (ret) {\n    // 服务端构建下单参数接口返回的支付信息\n    this.payInfo = ret.data.payInfo \n  }\n})\n// 2.发起支付\npay.requestCashierPayment({\n  orderInfo: { payInfo: this.payInfo },\n  success: function (data) {\n    console.log(`调起收银台成功, code = ${data.code}, message = ${data.message}`)\n  },\n  fail: function (message, code) {\n    console.log(`调起收银台失败, code = ${code}, message = ${message}`)\n  },\n})</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-eu9n6en2\">3、pay.isCashierAvailable()<strong>（最小支持引擎版本</strong><code>12000500</code>）</h2><p><strong>定义</strong>：判断设备是否支持收银台（安卓五和平板设备不支持收银台）</p><p><strong>参数</strong>：无</p><p><strong>返回值</strong>：true代表支持使用收银台能力，false代表不支持使用收银台能力</p><p><strong>示例</strong>：</p><pre><code>\ntry {\n    let res = pay.isCashierAvailable();\n    if (res) {\n       // 支持使用收银台\n    } else {\n       // 不支持使用收银台\n    }\n } catch (e) {\n      // 不支持使用收银台\n }</code></pre><p><br></p>","versionCode":4,"updateTime":1729763799000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,快应用支付平台接入,收银台模式,快应用调起收银台","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}